# PHARN development tooling: the owner's build pipeline, not part of Argus. Marked so GitHub leaves it
# out of the language statistics and collapses it in pull request diffs. None of it is published:
# package.json "files" ships dist/ only, and `npm run check:package` fails if anything else ships.
pharn/** linguist-vendored
.claude/** linguist-vendored
pharn.*.json linguist-generated
# PHARN's own threat model and limits (Argus's are docs/THREAT-MODEL.md and docs/LIMITS.md). They stay
# at the root because the PHARN installer, its write-guard hook and its drift records expect them there.
/THREAT-MODEL.md linguist-vendored
/LIMITS.md linguist-vendored
